### Check server
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### Filter products by name query string
GET http://localhost:3000/products?name=key

### Get one product by id
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### Create a product
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Monitor",
  "price": 199.99,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Create a product without quantity, so quantity defaults to 1
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Stand",
  "price": 39.99,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Try to create an invalid product
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 10
}

### Update part of a product
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 44.99,
  "quantity": 3
}

### Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/2

### Try to get a product that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/products/not-found
